* RBUTIL41 - BOARD DATABASE MAINTENANCE

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

A - Purpose, syntax and examples

:A
* RBUTIL41 - BOARD DATABASE MAINTENANCE

SYSOP ONLY. Private utility; use the local sysop console.

Syntax:
    SYSUTLS:RBUTIL41

Opens the installed board maintenance menu, which identifies itself as
RBBS 4.2.0 despite this compatibility filename. It can compact or read
messages, select/add forums, edit/compact users, import text and reset the
database.

STOP caller activity and back up I15: before maintenance. Menu choice 3
RESET DATABASE deletes existing accounts; it is not a routine refresh.
Prefer the normal board sysop workflow for ordinary administration. Exit
with the displayed Return to CP/M choice.

See HELP COMMANDS for the command index.
